### create new task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDk4NzMzMywiZXhwIjoxNzg0OTg3OTMzfQ.qz6Irs3nPQPceQwlAltzZlRfeb8A3zXopZWEaxFv1gI
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "test",
    "description": "this is a test task",
    "taskPriority": "medium",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-25"
}

### get all tasks in projects
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1/tasks?title=test&taskPriority=low
